  "At easier levels, move slowly until you learn the movement.": "Na ľahších úrovniach sa pohybujte pomaly, kým sa pohyb nenaučíte.",
  "At least 120 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 51 min of hard cardio a week; controlled vigorous blocks on Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday.": "Aspoň 120 minút plánovanej zóny 2 a približne 51 minút tvrdého kardia týždenne; kontrolované rázne bloky v utorok, štvrtok a sobotu.",
  "At New to training and Returning, keep the pace brisk and below all-out effort. At Active, work hard. At Well trained, use all-out effort.": "At New to training and Returning, udržujte svižné tempo a pod maximálnym úsilím. At Active, tvrdo pracujte. At Well trained, použite maximálne úsilie.",
  "At Returning and above, hold a dumbbell in each hand, or loop a band around your waist with its anchor in front of you. The band should pull you forward, like a sled.": "At Returning and above, držte činku v každej ruke alebo si okolo pása omotajte pás s kotvou pred vami. Páska by vás mala ťahať dopredu, ako sane.",
  "At Returning, push back up with your hands. At higher levels, pull yourself back with your hamstrings.": "At Returning, zatlačte rukami nahor. At higher levels, vytiahnite sa späť pomocou hamstringov.",
  "At the end of your last interval, note your peak heart rate. Walk gently for 60 seconds and note your heart rate again. Enter the drop (peak minus 60s reading).": "Na konci posledného intervalu si zaznamenajte svoju maximálnu srdcovú frekvenciu. Jemne kráčajte 60 sekúnd a znova si zaznamenajte svoju srdcovú frekvenciu. Zadajte pokles (vrchol mínus 60 sekúnd).",
