  "Athlete is now the default style and comes first; Mannequin is number 2. If you already picked a style, you keep it. Every exercise without styles still shows the mannequin.": "Athlete je teraz predvolený štýl a je na prvom mieste; Manekýn je číslo 2. Ak ste si už vybrali štýl, ponecháte si ho. Každé cvičenie bez štýlov stále ukazuje figurínu.",
  "Athlete wears a cobalt blue shirt, coral shorts and redesigned white trainers with blue panels and laces.": "Športovec má na sebe kobaltovo modrú košeľu, koralové šortky a prepracované biele tenisky s modrými panelmi a šnúrkami.",
