  "Keep the back leg long to stretch the hip flexor.": "Udržujte zadnú nohu dlhú, aby ste natiahli flexor bedra.",
  "Keep the effort controlled. Save near-max efforts for the short bursts and the ends of the 4×4 rounds.": "Udržujte úsilie pod kontrolou. Ušetrite takmer maximálne úsilie na krátke dávky a konce nábojov 4×4.",
  "Keep the effort gentle and focus on form before adding weight. Chin tucks and the doorway stretch are standard exercises outside Bryan's routine.": "Udržujte úsilie jemné a pred pridaním hmotnosti sa zamerajte na formu. Natiahnutie brady a natiahnutie dverí sú štandardné cvičenia mimo Bryanovej rutiny.",
  "Keep the knees bent so they travel forward over the toes, and push the floor away in front of you.": "Kolená majte ohnuté tak, aby sa posúvali dopredu cez prsty na nohách a tlačte podlahu pred seba.",
  "Keep the other leg long and both feet on the floor.": "Druhú nohu držte dlhú a obe chodidlá na podlahe.",
