  "Walk": "Prechádzka",
  "Walk around the room with slow, steady steps for 30–40 s.": "Kráčajte po miestnosti pomalými, stabilnými krokmi po dobu 30–40 s.",
  "Walk backward along a clear hallway, taking short steps and turning before the wall.": "Choďte dozadu po čistej chodbe, urobte krátke kroky a otočte sa pred stenou.",
  "Walk backward for 2 min along a clear stretch of hallway or living room. Turn around when you reach the wall.": "Kráčajte 2 minúty dozadu pozdĺž jasného úseku chodby alebo obývačky. Keď sa dostanete k stene, otočte sa.",
  "Walk backward for knee and back health": "Pre zdravie kolien a chrbta choďte dozadu",
