  "Walking and cardio show weight shifts, torso counter-rotation and changing elbow bends; curls turn the hands and dumbbells together.": "Chôdza a kardio ukazujú presuny hmotnosti, protirotáciu trupu a zmenu ohybov lakťov; kučery otáčajú ruky a činky dohromady.",
